Z||000001||batboy||04-22-2000||10:50 PM||||In 84 there was no GT Fieros made. There were a few Indy cars with the aero nose. In 85, the GT Fieros were notchback with the aero nose (I have one). All other GT Fieros (86-88) were fastback with the aero nose. All GT's had the V6 2.8 engine.||||reg||1
