Z||000014||87PegasusGT||04-24-2000||04:00 PM||||Um.... I beg to differ... You see, I got into an arguing match at a dealership over 2 86 Fieros. one a gold fastback, and one a red/silver notchback. I told the salesman repeatedly that the fastback was an 87. I was just a tad redfaced when he pulled the vin # on me and proved it to me. ||||reg||1
